# Canadian Payroll Service

Before planning or making changes in this repo, read **PROJECT_CONTEXT.md** at the project root and follow it as the source of truth for:

- Business model (Gamma Personnel proxy payroll)
- Architecture, stack, and folder layout
- API contracts, onboarding rules, and tax-slip behavior
- Environment defaults and operational constraints

If PROJECT_CONTEXT.md and the code disagree, ask before changing either. Do not revert to dropped architectures (Java/Spring, XSL-FO, Bitcoin).
